Namely, the local section $\text{d}_{X/S}(f) = 1 \otimes f - f \otimes 1$ of the ideal sheaf of $\Delta $ maps via $\text{d}_{X \times _ S X/X}$ to the local section $1 \otimes 1 \otimes 1 \otimes f - 1 \otimes f \otimes 1 \otimes 1 -1 \otimes 1 \otimes f \otimes 1 + f \otimes 1 \otimes 1 \otimes 1 = \text{pr}_2^*\text{d}_{X/S}(f) - \text{pr}_1^*\text{d}_{X/S}(f)$.